Upstream:      OrcaSlicer (github.com/SoftFever/OrcaSlicer): src/slic3r/GUI/Plater.cpp,
               src/slic3r/GUI/wxMediaCtrl2.cpp
Upstreamable:  yes
How:           A PR against main with both null checks. No issue or PR filed yet.
               It could also show the user why (missing printer profile, missing
               GStreamer plugin) instead of failing silently.
Written:       2026-05-24, against OrcaSlicer 2.3.2
Last checked:  2026-10-25: both unguarded dereferences are still in 2.4.2
Remove when:   the OrcaSlicer release that nixpkgs packages guards both
Applied by:    modules/desktop/orca-slicer.nix

Two NULL dereferences that crash OrcaSlicer.

Plater.cpp: project_filament_count = config_loaded.option<ConfigOptionStrings>(
"filament_colour")->size(). When a loaded 3mf's config has no filament_colour
as ConfigOptionStrings, option<>() returns nullptr and ->size() segfaults.
Reproduced by opening a Creality Print 3mf for an Ender-3 V3 SE without that
printer profile installed.

wxMediaCtrl2.cpp: the constructor reads m_imp->m_playbin and passes it to
g_object_set. 2.4.0 added the m_imp check; playbin is still dereferenced
unchecked, and it is NULL when GStreamer's registry has no playbin element
(see the GST_PLUGIN_SCANNER override in modules/desktop/orca-slicer.nix).
The patch guards both and does nothing else.

--- a/src/slic3r/GUI/Plater.cpp
+++ b/src/slic3r/GUI/Plater.cpp
@@ -6039,7 +6039,10 @@
                                 //set the size back
                                 partplate_list.reset_size(current_width + Bed3D::Axes::DefaultTipRadius, current_depth + Bed3D::Axes::DefaultTipRadius, current_height, false);
                             }
-                            project_filament_count = config_loaded.option<ConfigOptionStrings>("filament_colour")->size();
+                            {
+                                auto *filament_colour_opt = config_loaded.option<ConfigOptionStrings>("filament_colour");
+                                project_filament_count    = filament_colour_opt ? filament_colour_opt->size() : 0;
+                            }
                             partplate_list.load_from_3mf_structure(plate_data, project_filament_count);
                             partplate_list.update_slice_context_to_current_plate(background_process);
                             this->preview->update_gcode_result(partplate_list.get_current_slice_result());
--- a/src/slic3r/GUI/wxMediaCtrl2.cpp
